Playwright MCP Server
=====================

This project is a ground-up rewrite and redesign of the original
`playwright-mcp` package (https://pypi.org/project/playwright-mcp/).

Original Package
----------------
The original `playwright-mcp` package (version 0.1.0) provided a basic
Model Context Protocol server for Playwright browser automation.
It served as the inspiration and conceptual starting point for this project.

This Rewrite
------------
This project (`playwright-mcp-server`) is a complete redesign with:

- Modular architecture (config, browser, tools, executor, handlers, server)
- Full type annotations and mypy compliance
- Comprehensive test suite (unit + integration)
- Modern Python packaging (pyproject.toml)
- CLI with argparse
- Structured logging
- Proper resource management with context managers
- Extended tool set (16 tools vs ~9)

Third-Party Dependencies
------------------------
This project builds upon the following excellent open-source projects:

- **MCP (Model Context Protocol)** - https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/python-sdk
- **Playwright** - https://github.com/microsoft/playwright
- **Pydantic** - https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic

All third-party dependencies are used under their respective licenses.